    "date": "05 Jun",
    "readTime": "8 min read",
    "excerpt": "Running a successful Minecraft server requires the right tools. From LuckPerms to WorldGuard, here are the top 10 plugins every server needs in 2026.",
    "author": "VexaNode Team",
    "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607604276583-eef5d076aa5f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200",
    "content": "<header class=\"border-b border-gray-200 pb-8 dark:border-neutral-800\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-600\">Minecraft</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">Top 10 Must-Have Minecraft Plugins for 2026</h1><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-5 text-sm text-gray-500\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>June 5, 2026</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>8 min read</span><span>Manas</span></div></header><div class=\"pt-10\"><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Running a successful Minecraft server in 2026 requires more than just a great world. You need the right tools to manage your community, protect your assets, and enhance the gameplay. Here are our top 10 picks.</p><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607604276583-eef5d076aa5f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"Minecraft plugins\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-lg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\"/><h2 id=\"luckperms\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">1. LuckPerms</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Still the industry standard for permission management. LuckPerms allows you to create complex ranks and permissions with a beautiful web editor.</p><h2 id=\"worldguard\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">2. WorldGuard &amp; WorldEdit</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Essential for protecting your spawn area and allowing players to claim land. The bedrock of any survival or creative server.</p><h2 id=\"essentialsx\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">3. EssentialsX</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">The core of almost every Minecraft server. Provides hundreds of commands for teleporting, homes, kits, and more.</p><h2 id=\"coreprotect\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">4. CoreProtect</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">The best block logging and rollback tool. Essential for catching griefers and fixing mistakes instantly.</p><h2 id=\"geysermc\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">5. GeyserMC</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Allows Bedrock Edition players to join your Java server. A must-have for growing your player base in 2026.</p><h2 id=\"vault\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">6. Vault</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">The bridge between your economy and other plugins. Almost every shop or rank plugin requires Vault to function.</p><h2 id=\"multiverse\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">7. Multiverse-Core</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Easily manage multiple worlds on a single server instance. Perfect for separating survival from creative or mini-game areas.</p><h2 id=\"litebans\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">8. LiteBans</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">A premium-feeling punishment system that works across multiple servers. Perfect for large networks.</p><h2 id=\"vulcan\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">9. Vulcan Anti-Cheat</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Protect your server from hackers with one of the most reliable anti-cheat solutions on the market.</p><h2 id=\"plan\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">10. Plan (Player Analytics)</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Deep insights into your server performance and player behavior. Essential for server growth.</p></div>"
