    "content": "<header class=\"border-b border-gray-200 pb-8 dark:border-neutral-800\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-600\">Tutorials</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl\">Step-by-Step Guide: Setting Up Pterodactyl Panel on Ubuntu</h1><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-5 text-sm text-gray-500\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg>June 5, 2026</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>8 min read</span><span>Manas</span></div></header><div class=\"pt-10\"><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Pterodactyl is the industry standard for game server management. Here is how to set it up on Ubuntu.</p><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629654297299-c8506221ca97?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"Pterodactyl panel\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-lg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\"/><h2 id=\"prep\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">1. Preparation</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Ensure your Ubuntu VPS is up to date with the latest security patches and packages.</p><h2 id=\"deps\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">2. Dependencies</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Install PHP, Composer, Nginx, and other required tools for the panel.</p><h2 id=\"database\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">3. Database</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Set up MySQL or MariaDB for storing panel configuration and server data.</p><h2 id=\"wings\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 mt-10 mb-4 border-l-4 border-gray-900 pl-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:border-white dark:text-white\">4. Wings</h2><p class=\"my-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-300\">Install and configure Wings daemon to manage game server instances across nodes.</p></div>"
